        ": سَأَلْتُهُ عَنِ اَلتَّمَتُّعِ بِالْأَبْكَارِ قَالَ \"هَلْ جُعِلَ ذَلِكَ إِلاَّ لَهُنَّ فَلْيَسْتَتِرْنَ مِنْهُ وَ لْيَسْتَعْفِفْنَ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4611 - It is narrated from Ali ibn Asbat, from Muhammad ibn Udhafir, from someone he mentioned, who said: I asked Abu Abdullah (as) about engaging in temporary marriage with virgins.\nImam (as) replied: \"Was it not made permissible except for them? So let them observe modesty and chastity.\""
        ]
      }
